Running coder: qwen2.5-coder:7b
```python
import hashlib

def string_to_md5(text: str) -> str | None:
    if not isinstance(text, str):
        raise TypeError("Input must be a string")
    if text == "":
        return None
    md5_hash = hashlib.md5(text.encode()).hexdigest()
    return md5_hash
```
